<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 bln mark 30-year zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 bln mark 30-year zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB Effectenbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    05.NOV.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  13.73     PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP				  SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 REOFFER     13.73</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2024 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
